  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Embassy Orange Canvass Dressing</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is a 16 Day of Activism Against GBV campaign which will run from the 25th of November to the 10th of December 2025. The Embassy of the Kingdom of the Netherlands in South Africa will actively lead this year&#x2019;s campaign to raise awareness, share survivor resources, promote responsible digital behavior, and amplify South African voices working to build safer, more inclusive online spaces.  The campaign entails, mix video messages, infographics, photo stories, quotes, partner features, and survivor voices. It will also Include men and boys as allies, visually and in messaging and ensure representation of LGBTQIA+ individuals, youth, and persons with disabilities. The embassy outer gates will be dressed in an orange canvas drape to raise awareness during the campaign.</narrative>
  </description>
